<title>FINLAND: PT UPS FINNISH GDP GROWTH FORECASTS FOR 1996, 1997.</title>
<headline>PT UPS FINNISH GDP GROWTH FORECASTS FOR 1996, 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labour Institute for Economic</p>
<p>Research (PT) said in a statement on Monday it had raised its</p>
<p>forecasts for volume growth in the gross domestic product to 2.5</p>
<p>percent in 1996 and to 3.5 percent next year.</p>
<p>Its previous growth forecasts were 2.0 and 2.5 percent in</p>
<p>1996 and 1997 respectively.</p>
<p>&quot;An improvement in the international business cycle will</p>
<p>cheer exports and growth in domestic demand -- particularly</p>
<p>consumption -- will also strengthen,&quot; PT said.</p>
<p>Key figures in PT's 1996/2 forecast:</p>
<p>				  1995 actual 1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP			    +4.2	  +2.5	 +3.5</p>
<p> Exports			+8.3	    +2	   +4</p>
<p> Imports			+6.3	    +4	   +6</p>
<p> Consumption		  +3.1	  +2.5	   +3</p>
<p>   --private		  +3.8	    +3	 +3.5</p>
<p>   --public		   +1.3	    +2	 +1.5</p>
<p> Investment		   +7.7	    +7	   +5</p>
<p>   --private		 +10.9	    +7	   +4</p>
<p>   --public		   -6.1	    +6	  +10</p>
<p> CPI			    +1.0	  +0.5	 +1.5</p>
<p> Wage level		   +4.7	    +4	 +3.5</p>
<p> Unemployment		 17.2	  16.4	 15.5</p>
<p> C/A (FIM billion)	 +24.7	   +23	  +22</p>
<p>Public sector deficit</p>
<p>   as pct of GDP	     5.2	   3.8	  2.7</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
